---
import { withBase } from '../../../utils/paths';
---

<section class="representative-events" aria-labelledby="representative-events-title">
  <header>
    <p>Signal examples</p>
    <div>
      <h2 id="representative-events-title">What the classes look like</h2>
      <p>
        Ripple, IED, and ambiguous events can overlap in waveform shape and frequency content,
        particularly across subjects and recording channels.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <figure>
    <picture>
      <source
        srcset={withBase('media/neural-event-classification/02_representative_events.webp')}
        type="image/webp"
      />
      <img
        src={withBase('media/neural-event-classification/02_representative_events.svg')}
        alt="Three representative neural events shown as 300-millisecond multichannel waveforms and colored spectrograms: a ripple, an IED, and an ambiguous noise event."
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </picture>
    <figcaption>
      The 300 ms traces show the morphology surrounding each event, while the model classifies the centered 100 ms segment. 
      Examples are drawn from three different subjects and were selected to represent a clear ripple, a typical IED, and an 
      ambiguous event between the two classes. Spectrograms are shown to illustrate their frequency structure, although the 
      final compact model operates directly on the waveform and does not include a spectrogram branch.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<style>
  .representative-events { margin: 0 0 var(--project-section-gap); padding: 28px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .representative-events > header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 112px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .representative-events > header > p {
    margin: 3px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--project-label-size);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
  }
  .representative-events h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    font-size: var(--project-heading-size);
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
  }
  .representative-events header div > p {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: var(--project-body-size);
    line-height: var(--project-body-leading);
  }
  .representative-events figure { margin: 0; }
  .representative-events picture,
  .representative-events img { display: block; width: 100%; }
  .representative-events img { height: auto; background: #111210; }
  .representative-events figcaption {
    margin: 14px 0 0 140px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--project-support-size);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .representative-events > header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .representative-events h2 { font-size: var(--project-heading-size); }
    .representative-events figcaption { margin-left: 0; }
  }
</style>
